{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11111200","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11111200","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1111120001:1":{"text":"来たぞ、フランク。","source_cn":"弗兰克，我来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB6919B4E4C452D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111120002:1":{"text":"失せろ。獲物の骨で爪を研いどる時は誰も邪魔すんじゃねぇ言うたじゃろうが！","source_cn":"滚开，用猎物骨头磨爪子的享乐时间，谁都不许打扰我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEEFC6F3C5F1CECF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111120003:1":{"text":"顔を上げろ。そして潔く自分の運命と向き合え、この悪党！","source_cn":"抬起头，堂堂正正地面对你的命运，恶棍！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93AF8D86F4D53786","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111120004:1":{"text":"あ？ウォルクじゃねぇか！懐かしき友よ！","source_cn":"啊，瓦尔克，我的老朋友！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FB3F47C3296357B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111120005:1":{"text":"なぜわしに銃を向ける？わしがおどれの相棒を弾いたからか？","source_cn":"为什么拿枪指着我？就因为我料理了你的搭档？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37E2BC6538CF58C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1